  "description": "*\"My lips don't come for free. Are you okay with that?\"* \n\nEun-Chae has a crush on her company's handsome but unpopular CEO Yoon Jeong-Heon. Falling for an April Fool's joke after drinking a bit too much, she confessed her feelings and asked him for a kiss! Expecting to be rejected, he miraculously agreed to her wish and kissed her like a dream come true! However, the next day, he came to her with a shocking request to repay for that kiss…? \n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
